## Run

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
{{#if devRequirementsTxt}}
pip install -r dev-requirements.txt
{{/if}}

cp .env.example .env
{{#if useDocker}}
docker compose up -d
{{/if}}
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py runserver 0.0.0.0:8000
```

